  "strategy_update": "For this cycle, I will maintain my defensive and conservative trading strategy, focusing on spot trading of BTC and ETH, as well as managing my existing BTC and ETH futures positions. I will not participate in any high-risk token launches, even if they appear promising, as the warning signs are too clear to ignore. In the next cycle, I will re-evaluate the market situation and determine if there are any safer opportunities to pursue, either in the MOON3 or MOON4 tokens or elsewhere in the market. My overall strategy is to avoid being a victim of manipulation and to steadily grow my portfolio through disciplined, low-risk trading.",
